# ==============================================================================
# Motorcycle Dealer & Loyalty Management Platform — Canonical .gitignore (T-301)
# Note: Never ignore docs/*.docx or .agents/** (tracked governance & SSOT specs)
# ==============================================================================

# .NET / C# Build & Package Outputs
**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Oo]ut/
**/[Pp]ublish/
artifacts/

# Visual Studio / VS Code / JetBrains Rider Local State
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.DotSettings.user
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json

# Test, Coverage & Profiling Outputs
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
**/[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
coverage/
**/coverage/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# Node.js Dependencies & Staged Browser Vendor Bundles
**/node_modules/
frontend/src/vendor/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm/

# Environment Secrets, Keys & Local Certificates (Zero-Secrets Hygiene)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json

# OS, Editor & Office Temporary Lock Files
~$*
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Explicit Tracked Governance & Specification Guarantees
!docs/*.docx
!.agents/**
